assume the position in an acting capacity.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>New Ukraine talks including Europe to be held 'soon' — Merz</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bb69c8c6db0270a27483d62645f277c719f81469027534488b1c8a8bb8f71897</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:32:21Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T01:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/new-ukraine-talks-including-europe-to-be-held-soon-merz/a-79997961--25ea534d77af.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/new-ukraine-talks-including-europe-to-be-held-soon-merz/a-79997961?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's Chancellor Friedrich Merz says European leaders could take part in fresh Ukraine talks on "neutral ground." The UK and EU countries have urged a seat at the table in meetings between the US, Russia and Ukraine.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Cincinnati's famous hippo Fiona dies after eating visitor's hat</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ef02af2f493038613d7120f4ee5631b4a8ec039359f08f74a3d78983afc4ef30</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:32:24Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T01:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/cincinnati-s-famous-hippo-fiona-dies-after-eating-visitor-s-hat/a-79998371--c1abf377d83b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/cincinnati-s-famous-hippo-fiona-dies-after-eating-visitor-s-hat/a-79998371?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Fiona was a global sensation at the Cincinnati Zoo in the US. The hippo, who was born prematurely, was named after the "Shrek" film character.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Price tag for US war in Iran barrels past $48 billion</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c636107a388a48962ea930ec04640953bf62176ae48d8f6bf5de9eb2d1346382</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:32:27Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T23:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/price-tag-for-us-war-in-iran-barrels-past-48-billion/a-79998255--730de4605f63.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/price-tag-for-us-war-in-iran-barrels-past-48-billion/a-79998255?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Pentagon budget officer has said the price of the Iran war surpassed $48.3 billion last week. That does not include costs sustained in Iranian attacks on US bases — lawmakers want details the Pentagon is loath to give.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'Humanitarian mission' for Kostiantynivka: Is it a trap?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a1f52c1a7cab42e331837de2d460c084712cc838d7bacd57a5b8a52975b30873</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:32:30Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T20:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/humanitarian-mission-for-kostiantynivka-is-it-a-trap/a-79996772--b2c55375bd3f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/humanitarian-mission-for-kostiantynivka-is-it-a-trap/a-79996772?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Russian President Putin has proposed an evacuation of the Ukrainian city of Kostiantynivka, like the recent operation in Oleshky. Experts warn this could serve military, not humanitarian, aims. What should Kyiv do?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Uganda minister at COP31: 'We need a just transition'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:75e34f38f9396b2e2f8500823819af4aa67008c44f71bb559c01ce95534c8201</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:32:33Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T19:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uganda-minister-at-cop31-we-need-a-just-transition/a-79997209--312e033bb073.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uganda-minister-at-cop31-we-need-a-just-transition/a-79997209?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Funding from wealthy countries to help deal with the impacts of climate change hasn't materialized, says Uganda's environment minister. The East African country is hoping oil and carbon credits will help boost finances.</summary><category term="Climate" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Pistorius visits Auschwitz memorial in Poland trip</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:02ecdae831c17e404214d2062ff8cc38e1e4675b5c98c7ea8c76f5c061bb979c</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:32:36Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T18:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-pistorius-visits-auschwitz-memorial-in-poland-trip/live-79987991--a7bef4a1dbc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-pistorius-visits-auschwitz-memorial-in-poland-trip/live-79987991?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany's defense minister's first stop in Poland was the memorial site of the former Nazi extermination camp Auschwitz-Birkenau. Follow DW for more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iraq's risky standoff: The state vs. Iran-allied militias</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:896d3138d9dbe3f107119a64f133e64ed63df6951001993f0a88126307908fcd</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:32:39Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T18:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iraq-s-risky-standoff-the-state-vs-iran-allied-militias/a-79995757--f4b636b89172.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iraq-s-risky-standoff-the-state-vs-iran-allied-militias/a-79995757?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">This week, Iraqi security forces surrounded an area run by the Kataib Hezbollah militia. Onlookers describe it as the most dangerous confrontation between the Iraqi state and Iran-allied militias in decades.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>European leaders present united front in push for peace in Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:63f9b47bf723e5cebf433607a6a9ed60a836683e02ea0229d02e16c7d386d430</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:32:42Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T18:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/european-leaders-present-united-front-in-push-for-peace-in-ukraine/live-79986520--bfc9540094fc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/european-leaders-present-united-front-in-push-for-peace-in-ukraine/live-79986520?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Talks in Berlin end with reaffirmed support for Kyiv and a concerted push for European representation at future peace talks to end Russia's invasion of Ukraine.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Xi Jinping, Donald Trump and Vladimir Putin have held trilateral talks ― but what did they achieve?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e36f5edcfc536f70d1f44a27c44063084c05f9d16f5f244de10d718c3dbabbef</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:32:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T17:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/xi-jinping-donald-trump-and-vladimir-putin-have-held-trilateral-talks-_-but-what-did-they-achieve/a-79996668--6af4ec68160a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/xi-jinping-donald-trump-and-vladimir-putin-have-held-trilateral-talks-―-but-what-did-they-achieve/a-79996668?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The presidents of China, the US and Russia have held an unprecedented summit. While Trump said the three leaders were "making history," Xi described the talks as "fruitful" and Putin called them "open and candid."</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>No mention of fossil fuels in latest COP31 draft deal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2374ac1151e7f23e51e70aa6462702c179c17b7c35c31a686bb901b1fd2fbc76</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T16:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/no-mention-of-fossil-fuels-in-latest-cop31-draft-deal/a-79992394--36cfb19df8f5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/no-mention-of-fossil-fuels-in-latest-cop31-draft-deal/a-79992394?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">One of the most fraught debates at the UN climate talks in Turkey has revolved around the future of coal, oil and gas. Now, all mention of fossil fuels has been removed from the summit's new draft agreement.</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Anthropic trading tests investors' appetite for AI</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:2a02b931fb70f439bd460fad9bdbff91f26bdfc6b813991938690422a7d4a37d</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T15:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/anthropic-trading-tests-investors-appetite-for-ai/a-79993163--d18c2700770b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/anthropic-trading-tests-investors-appetite-for-ai/a-79993163?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Anthropic was valued at $2 trillion after shares started trading on the Nasdaq following a record $81 billion IPO. Its performance will put investor confidence in AI to the test.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Alexander Zverev faces fresh lawsuit from ex-girlfriend</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ec5290bebefe258bbc8c16c2caf4666bb5b4a400753e5bf2cac281c95a14ec63</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T15:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/alexander-zverev-faces-fresh-lawsuit-from-ex-girlfriend/a-79990005--d63dbeaa4aae.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/alexander-zverev-faces-fresh-lawsuit-from-ex-girlfriend/a-79990005?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">World No. 1 tennis player Alexander Zverev is facing a new lawsuit related to a domestic abuse trial. The lawyer for his ex-girlfriend, Brenda Patea, told DW what the allegations are against the German player.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>EU Commission confirms it was targeted in cyberattack using AI tools</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6f93ec71336ad88dce92239ab2a06b4dd58c93096e2b13f648eafe4d89f05a20</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T14:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-commission-confirms-it-was-targeted-in-cyberattack-using-ai-tools/a-79993016--2e1cd85b257c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-commission-confirms-it-was-targeted-in-cyberattack-using-ai-tools/a-79993016?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The European Commission was targeted by an "AI-generated cybercampaign," a spokesperson has said. This is the first time the bloc has publicly reported an AI-based cyberattack.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Wadephul: 'Coalition of the Willing' talks in Berlin send strong signal to Moscow</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:aa1d92da5d9f4823d3487821a9b9da14b3fca1bf20335616ceab4e5769bd4deb</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T13:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/wadephul-coalition-of-the-willing-talks-in-berlin-send-strong-signal-to-moscow/a-79990664--ce1ce93ebd6c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/wadephul-coalition-of-the-willing-talks-in-berlin-send-strong-signal-to-moscow/a-79990664?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">German Foreign Minister Wadephul has said the Coalition of the Willing meeting in Berlin sends a clear message to Moscow to take peace talks seriously. He also warned Ukraine should be prepared for peace talks to fail.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Pakistan minister to visit India, but no breakthrough expected</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e8c8c8469b66a57b5819c07e789e3e75df019fa22d8f562edcfee52f766db839</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T13:26:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pakistan-minister-to-visit-india-but-no-breakthrough-expected/a-79991717--07503556e8b2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pakistan-minister-to-visit-india-but-no-breakthrough-expected/a-79991717?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A Pakistani minister's visit to India for a Shanghai Cooperation Organization forum marks a rare high-level contact between the two archrivals, but analysts say it does not signal a resumption of bilateral engagement.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>APEC summit: Trump, Xi, Putin talks end with 'peace declaration'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:fac84e53e7300322be699393783c7af6e781a8f717d69a608555f41b4d8b4f81</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T13:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/apec-summit-trump-xi-putin-talks-end-with-peace-declaration/live-79964719--35792a5d6dfa.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/apec-summit-trump-xi-putin-talks-end-with-peace-declaration/live-79964719?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The three world leaders discussed the Russian invasion of Ukraine as well as nuclear arms controls. Following the trilateral talks, President Trump reportedly headed to the airport.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Myanmar committed genocide against Rohingya, top UN court rules</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:44bb6cf16758bfb5e32c213c81f5284a08e0bcc50efbd485f5592d4b0fbe87ea</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T11:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/myanmar-committed-genocide-against-rohingya-top-un-court-rules/a-79987898--1622af9cbda3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/myanmar-committed-genocide-against-rohingya-top-un-court-rules/a-79987898?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The International Court of Justice has upheld large parts of a genocide case against Myanmar linked to the 2017 conflict with its Rohingya minority. It called for it to pay reparations and let refugees return safely.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Denmark ratifies security deal with US and Greenland</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f9e076d1dc3366f8081dc9a6b4055d2d562e9389153ca2d5b0ec4513827929f7</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T10:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/denmark-ratifies-security-deal-with-us-and-greenland/a-79988989--97c7c7d282a7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/denmark-ratifies-security-deal-with-us-and-greenland/a-79988989?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The deal provides the US with expanded military access, on top of what it already had based on a previous agreement. It comes after threats by US President Trump to take Greenland with force.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Iran balances ties with China and Russia as Trump ramps up pressure</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a83322918f75f468167b04c591dc33d90c939b7ee18ca0ac7d5bca983f62be7b</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T09:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/iran-balances-ties-with-china-and-russia-as-trump-ramps-up-pressure/a-79979920--3c92417b16df.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/iran-balances-ties-with-china-and-russia-as-trump-ramps-up-pressure/a-79979920?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">As Donald Trump seeks to tighten economic pressure on Iran, China remains its biggest oil customer and Russia a key partner. But both powers are balancing support for Tehran against broader interests with Washington.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Is the AI bubble bursting just as Anthropic goes public?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:48a412ed91a48a629e68db30c22960227c24f4a67516e381fd917d2fb4bb14ac</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-19T05:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/is-the-ai-bubble-bursting-just-as-anthropic-goes-public/a-79896537--10f78cdc2264.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/is-the-ai-bubble-bursting-just-as-anthropic-goes-public/a-79896537?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The sharp sell-off in tech stocks after the US midterms and the Nvidia scandal has cast doubt on Anthropic's IPO. Yet with hundreds of billions still being invested, some think the AI party is still in full swing.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Borussia Dortmund bows to fan pressure and end Rheinmetall deal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b4f39f07a510f56a9a47a288417de94d7d41dcb2bc842219d33a47fbd9313a59</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T15:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/borussia-dortmund-bows-to-fan-pressure-and-end-rheinmetall-deal/a-79980121--2c9b64a964f9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/borussia-dortmund-bows-to-fan-pressure-and-end-rheinmetall-deal/a-79980121?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Borussia Dortmund has reluctantly ended its association with a major sponsor after long-term fan protests. They are not the first Bundesliga club to u-turn, as commercial interests clash with politics and fan culture.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>'Coalition of the Willing' meets in Berlin: Europe remains committed to Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f3930016df5419612ec1f079beac48cf1683a3134ce50e18048aff1ca80e1e56</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T15:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/coalition-of-the-willing-meets-in-berlin-europe-remains-committed-to-ukraine/a-79974996--9529e6865e8b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/coalition-of-the-willing-meets-in-berlin-europe-remains-committed-to-ukraine/a-79974996?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The "Coalition of the Willing" supporting Ukraine is gathering in Berlin. One of the key issues under discussion is whether Europe will be able to play a role in future negotiations over the country's future.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Has the 'Parthenon puzzle' been solved? The long quest to reassemble lost eastern pediment</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:da13b720fb87686aee7efa75ba6cf2badca341c71b827c959e47adfe6c6e580a</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T14:49:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/has-the-parthenon-puzzle-been-solved-the-long-quest-to-reassemble-lost-eastern-pediment/a-79982098--4f23b2ccbfc4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/has-the-parthenon-puzzle-been-solved-the-long-quest-to-reassemble-lost-eastern-pediment/a-79982098?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The depiction of the birth of the goddess Athena above the Parthenon's entrance is considered a masterpiece of ancient art. Now, a German research team has pieced together all the surviving fragments.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>How a green economy could help reverse climate change</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e043ed9c0ddbf4d1fdd68bfaab62ed4d2084d70113bce2043bf3494845224e95</id><updated>2026-11-20T07:31:15Z</updated><published>2026-11-18T09:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-a-green-economy-could-help-reverse-climate-change/a-79874576--23cc55e56fdb.html" type="text/html" /><li